+## 11. LLM Integration & Fallback Strategy
+
+### 11.1 Unified LLM Client (`core/llm/client.py`)
+
+**`invoke_llm()`** is the single entry point for all LLM calls across the entire codebase. It implements a 3-tier fallback chain:
+
+```
+Attempt 1..N (MAX_RETRIES=4):
+Γöé
+Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ 1. GPU Server (Ollama / Remote)
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Try primary port
+Γöé      ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ If port 11435 fails, try port 11434
+Γöé
+Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ 2. Gemini API (if SWITCHES["FALLBACK_TO_GEMINI"])
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ 6 API keys in round-robin
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ 80s timeout per attempt
+Γöé      ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ Cycles through all keys on failure
+Γöé
+ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ 3. OpenAI API (if SWITCHES["FALLBACK_TO_OPENAI"])
+       ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ gpt-4o-mini
+```
+
+### 11.2 Output Parsing Pipeline
+
+````
+Raw LLM output
+Γöé
+Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Strategy 1: sanitize_llm_json() + PydanticOutputParser.parse()
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Strip markdown fences (```json...```)
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Replace unicode whitespace, remove zero-width chars
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Extract JSON block from preamble text
+Γöé      Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ Escape control characters
+Γöé      ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ Parse with Pydantic
+Γöé
+ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ Strategy 2: parse_llm_json() with json_repair
+       Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ json.loads() attempt
+       Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ sanitize + json.loads()
+       Γö£ΓöÇΓöÇ json_repair library (fixes trailing commas, single quotes, etc.)
+       ΓööΓöÇΓöÇ Pydantic model_validate()
+````
+
+### 11.3 LLM Configurations
+
+Two LLM wrapper classes:
+
+**Local (`local_llm.py`):**
+
+- Wraps `ChatOllama` from langchain-ollama
+- Semaphore-based concurrency control per (model, port) ΓÇö matches `OLLAMA_NUM_PARALLEL`
+- Strips `<think>` and `<reasoning>` tags from output
+- Cached instances to avoid re-initialization
+
+**Remote (`remote_llm.py`):**
+
+- HTTP POST to a GPU server endpoint
+- Same `<think>` tag stripping
+- 600s timeout
+
