+"""
+Prompt templates for the Exhaustive Analysis Mode.
+
+MAP_PROMPT ΓÇö sent per-batch during the map phase.
+REDUCE_PROMPT ΓÇö sent once during the reduce phase to synthesize all batch outputs.
+"""
